# a 3 by 3 grid: lists inside a list
me has grid list
count r from 1 to 3
    me has row list
    count c from 1 to 3
        row gain r * c
    grid gain row
say grid
say item 2 of item 3 of grid
item 2 of item 2 of grid is 0
say item 2 of grid
me has total 0
each line in grid
    each cell in line
        total gain cell
say total
